<title>CHILE: Chile to release economic figures Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Chile to release economic figures Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's National Statistics Institute delayed by one day the release of economic figures including October inflation and July-to-September unemployment numbers.</p>
<p>The figures had been due to be released Monday but instead will be issued Tuesday at about 1030 local (1330 GMT), an official at the institute said.  He gave no reason for the delay.</p>
<p>--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom *56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
